{
  "description": "The member order a `sort` gives the grouped References readers (`sort_ids`, `agaric-store/src/backlink/sort.rs`), which `query_backlinks_grouped.json` leaves unpinned. Four sources on page B2 link to B1. `Created` is id order in either direction. A property sort orders by its variant's column, `NULLS LAST` in BOTH directions with ties by id ascending: B6 has no due date, no priority and no estimate, and stays last every time. `due_date` and `priority` are reserved keys, which live in their `blocks` column and never in `block_properties`, so their sort reads the column. `estimate` is a `block_properties` number read through `value_num`, where 10 must sort after 9 (a text sort would put it first). Re-author `expected` via CONFORMANCE_UPDATE=1.",
